{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05296","headline":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得枝字 · 韦安石","name":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得枝字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重九开秋节，得一动宸仪。\n金风飘菊蘂，玉露泫萸枝。\n睿览八紘外，天文七曜披。\n临深应在即，居高岂忘危。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦安石","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05296.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05296","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}